<span id="S4.T2.2.3.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">Diverse domain coverage (CS, Chemistry, Math, Physics) <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib6" title="" class="ltx_ref">6</a>]</cite></span>
</span></td></tr>
